{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete: \n\nGO:2000905 | negative regulation of starch metabolic process\nGO:1902066 | regulation of cell wall pectin metabolic process\nGO:0032882 | regulation of chitin metabolic process\nGO:0070873 | regulation of glycogen metabolic process\nGO:2000904 | regulation of starch metabolic process\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30570\n\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here:\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/12BD6sRPruZ9DW2tBckvQNqZXF3bF9qfI_XRO4hjHWjY/edit?usp=sharing\n\nAnnotations could be moved to a corresponding or more granular regulation of biosynthetic or catabolic process term, or removed.\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nFlyBase  3\nCGD  15\nMGI  3\nSGD  3\nUniProt  11\nZFIN  1\nTAIR  16\nCACAO  1\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-07-14T15:36:30Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:2000905, GO:1902066, GO:0032882, GO:0070873, GO:2000904", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-11-09T22:59:43Z"}
